SUMMARY:GTApreneurs September 9-2026 Toronto Business Networking Event
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\nJoin us for
  a vibrant Business Networking Event in Toronto where you may meet your ne
 xt client or referral partner. Discover opportunities and connect! Registe
 r now.\n\n**REGISTER HERE:** https://gtapreneurs.com/networking-events-tor
 onto\n\n**VENUE:** The Village Hive Eglinton\n**ADDRESS:** 120 Eglinton Av
 e E\, 3rd floor event space\, Toronto\, ON\n**TRANSIT:** Get off at Eglint
 on subway station\, walk East down Eglinton a few minutes and you will fin
 d it on the north side of the street in a tall office building\n**PARKING:
 ** Parking garage in Loblaws building (entrance on Lilian Street)\n\n**ITI
 NERARY:**\n\n* **6:00-7:00pm:** Open networking\n* **7:00-7:05pm:** GTApre
 neurs’ presentation\n* **7:05-7:15pm:** Venue Host presentation: Serene 
 Chin\n* **7:15-8:00pm:** Open networking\n\n\\*Appetizers and beverages pr
 ovided.\n\n**TICKETS:**\n**GTApreneurs' Referral Group\, Exhibitor and Meg
 a Networking Members:** Free\n**Non-members:** $22 in advance or $25 on ev
 ent day\n***\\*Includes a Guest Contact Sheet*** emailed to you the day af
 ter the event. Note: You need to attend the event to receive the sheet.\n\
 n**HOSTS:**\n**Tammy Defoe\,** President of GTApreneurs\nLearn more about 
 Tammy’s Coaching services at www.gtapreneurs.com/business-coaching-toron
 to\n\n**QUESTIONS ABOUT THE EVENT?** Call 416-522-7770 or email info@gtapr
 eneurs.com\n\nand\n\n**Serene Chin**\, Community Manager at The Village Hi
 ve Eglinton.\n\nSerene is the friendly and dedicated Community Manager at 
 The Village Hive’s Eglinton location in midtown Toronto. Serene brings a
  wealth of experience as an entrepreneur and mortgage broker\, along with 
 a passion for community. She founded one of the GTA’s first dog cake bak
 eries\, blending her love for dogs with her entrepreneurial spirit. An act
 ive community leader with the Leitchcroft Community Association\, Serene i
 s always focused on building connections and supporting local businesses. 
 Fluent in four languages and a volunteer with the Markham Dog Alliance\, s
 he brings warmth\, enthusiasm\, and a true connector’s spirit to The Hiv
 e.\n\n**CONTACT SERENE:**\n\\(647\\) 500\\-0980 \\| [www.thevillagehive.ca
 /eglinton](www.thevillagehive.ca/eglinton) \\| info@eglintonhive\\.ca\n\nV
 iew all of GTApreneurs events and services at www.gtapreneurs.com\n\nWe lo
 ok forward to seeing you there!
