SUMMARY:GTApreneurs' September 17\, 2026 Speed Business Networking Event i
 n Pickering
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\nJoin us for
  an exciting Business Networking Event at CASUAL restaurant at Pickering C
 asino Resort on Thursday September 17\, 2026 where you can mix n mingle wi
 th other friendly entrepreneurs and small business owners who may become y
 our clients or referral partners.\n\n***Appetizers provided. \\*Cash bar.*
 **\n\nThis is casual\, social networking event where you can stand or sit 
 to connect with new people or with familiar faces. We will start with ice 
 breakers to ease into the open networking. We will provide you with a Gues
 t Contact Sheet by 5pm the day after the day\, but\, bring your business c
 ards to share too. It will help those you meet to remember you.\n\n**REGIS
 TER HERE:** https://gtapreneurs.com/business-networking-events-pickering\n
 \n* **TIME:** 6:00-8:00pm\n* **VENUE:** CASUAL Restaurant\, Pickering Casi
 no Resort\n* **ADDRESS:** 888 Durham Live Ave\, Pickering\, ON\n* **PARKIN
 G:** Free\, onsite – park in front of the main entrance\n\n**EVENT ITINE
 RARY:**\n\n* **6:00-7:00pm:** Open networking + appetizers + buy your own 
 beverage\n* **7:00-8:00pm:** 1-1 Speed networking – 3 minutes/table then
  rotate\n\n**TICKETS**\n\n* **GTApreneurs' Referral Group\, Exhibitor and 
 Mega Networking Members:** Free\n* **Non-members:** $22 in advance or $25 
 on event day\n\n**QUESTIONS ABOUT THE EVENT?**\nCall or text **Yolande** a
 t 705-710-9026 or email mmlf-info@consultant.com\n\nNot a GTApreneurs Memb
 er? Go here to view our memberships and register: https://gtapreneurs.com/
 business-networking-memberships
