SUMMARY:GTApreneurs BizX 2026 Business Expo and Conference – VIP Ticket
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\nYou are inv
 ited to an exciting mega networking bash! Join us on **Tuesday\, October 2
 0\, 2026** for **GTApreneurs’** **BizX 2026 Business Expo and Conference
 !** We expect 300+ small business owners and entrepreneurs all looking to 
 meet you and many others to do business together!\n\n**REGISTER HERE** \\>
 \\> [https://gtapreneurs.com/bizx2026](https://gtapreneurs.com/bizx2026/)\
 n\n**VENUE:** Hazelton Manor\n**ADDRESS:** 99 Peelar Rd\, Vaughan\, ON\n**
 PARKING:** Free\, onsite\n\n**VIP Ticket Itinerary:**\n\n* **9:00-10:30am:
 ** Registration + **Continental breakfast** +Networking\n* **10:30-10:45am
 :** GTApreneurs welcoming presentation\n* **10:45-11:00am:** Platinum and 
 Gold Sponsor Introductions\n* **11:00-11:20am:** Featured Speaker 1 presen
 tation – **Nile Saïd**\n* **11:20-11:40am:** Featured Speaker 2 present
 ation – **Angie Nezarati\, *“Your income works\, your capital doesn’
 t – yet”***\n* **11:40-12:00pm:** Featured Speaker 3 presentation – 
 **Muhammad Murtaza Khan** *presentation\, **“Stop Guessing\, Start Growi
 ng: The Strategic Power of Cash Flow Forecasting.”***\n* **12:15-2:00pm:
  VIP Lunch** (Vegetarian\, vegan and gluten-free options available)\n* **1
 2:30-4:15pm:** BizX 2026 Expo\n* **2:30-2:50pm:** Featured Speaker 4 prese
 ntation – **Bruno Teixeira\, *“AI for Business Owners”***\n* **2:50-
 3:10pm:** Featured Speaker 5 presentation – **Helen Ching\, *“Early bi
 rd gets the worm. Early planning accumulates significant business wealth.
 ”***\n* **4:30-5:00pm: Awards ceremony** \\>BizX 2026 Expo Contest winne
 rs\\\, guest door prize draw\\\, exhibitor draw \\> **Great prizes to be w
 on!**\n\n\\*Refreshments available all day – Coffee\, tea\, juice\, pop\
 , water\n\\*Snacks available until 4:15pm\n\n**VIP TICKETS:**\n\n* $59 reg
 ular or $49 until August 31\, 2026\n* Free for Mega\, Exhibitor and Referr
 al Group members\n\n**Not a member?** Join us today >> [https://gtapreneur
 s.com/business-networking-memberships](https://gtapreneurs.com/business-ne
 tworking-memberships)\n\n**Book an exhibitor table at BizX 2026\,** click 
 here >> [https://gtapreneurs.com/product/bizx2026-business-expo-exhibitor]
 (https://gtapreneurs.com/product/bizx2026-business-expo-exhibitor)\n\n**Sp
 onsor BizX 2026**\, send us a message >> info@gtapreneurs.com\n\n**DOOR PR
 IZE RAFFLE:** Bring your business card and drop it in the box for a chance
  to win a great prize.\n\n**BIZX 2026 BUSINESS EXPO CONTEST:** Each time y
 ou visit an exhibitor\, and exchange business cards (or exchange informati
 on electronically)\, they will put a sticker on your event map. Fill your 
 map with a sticker from every exhibitor to win a prize. At the end of the 
 day (4:30-5:00pm)\, we will announce Expo Contest winners as well as guest
  door prize winners and exhibitor draw winners.\n\n**SPONSORED BY:**\n\n* 
 **Sonia Kurmey\,** Arbonne\, www.soniakurmey.arbonne.com\n* **Balbir Pabil
 a\,** PPLSI\\~LegalShield\, https://bkpabila.legalshieldassociate.com\n\n*
 *DISCLAIMERS**\n***Event Photo and Video Disclaimer:*** By registering for
  and/or attending GTApreneurs (“Us” and “Our” and “We”) Events
 \, you give Us consent to use your image and/or video for Our publications
 \, advertising and/or other media activities (including the Internet).\n\n
 ***Information Sharing:*** By registering for or attending a GTApreneurs n
 etworking event\, you are agreeing to share your name\, professional title
 \, organization name\, city\, website (if given) and LinkedIn URL (if give
 n) with the other event attendees who attend that event. If you indicate i
 n your registration form that you give Us permission to share your phone n
 umber and/or your email address with the other event attendees\, we will s
 hare the information you give Us permission to share. If you indicate in t
 he registration form that you don’t give Us permission to share your pho
 ne number and/or your email address with the other attendees\, We will not
  share it with the other attendees. GTApreneurs will never share your home
  address with anyone.\n\n***Event Guest Contact Sheet:*** Your ticket does
  not include the Guest or Exhibitor Contact Sheets.
